1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,302
The second derivative, twelve x times x minus two, changes sign at zero and at two.

2
00:00:06,302 --> 00:00:10,247
Those are the points of inflection, where the bending switches.

3
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:17,213
Notice x equals zero: the slope is zero there too, but it is not a maximum or minimum.

4
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:21,445
The only extreme is the minimum at x equals three.

